   "prompt": "Build a goal check-in list like Finch's.\n- 360 pt wide on a green scene (#7BB55C).\n- Header: white calendar icon 23 x 21 pt, then 3 goals left today! in Rubik Bold 21 pt, white.\n- Section row: START THE DAY (Rubik Semibold 12.2 pt, 0.09em, white), a 1.2 pt #B9DEA5 rule, a 27 x 19 pt #96C57D button with a white down chevron.\n- Goal cards: 360 x 78 pt, #FFFFFF, 23.5 pt corners, 8 pt apart.\n- In a card: 3 drag dots (#99A8B1), a 54 pt #EFEFEF squircle with a 34 pt icon, the goal name in Rubik Semibold 16.6 pt #2E2E2E.\n- Right side: reward 5 (Rubik 14.1 pt #697379) with an 11 x 17 pt #FEAC31 bolt, then the check button.\n- Check button: 46 x 38 pt #F0F0F0 key, 13 pt corners, 4 pt #D7D7D7 bottom edge, 17 x 16 pt #52B74E check (4 pt round stroke).\n- Pressed: the face drops 4 pt and the edge hides.\n- Data rule: each check drops the header count by 1 and adds 5 energy.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
