   "prompt": "Build an adventure timer card like Finch's.\n- Card 360.5 x 87 pt, #F7F8F7, 19.9 pt corners, on a green scene (#7BB55C) with 16.5 pt margins.\n- Top row, baseline 32 pt: Adventuring (Rubik Semibold 16.6 pt, #303030) at x 21; back in 7:36 (Rubik Medium 14.1 pt, #69737A, tabular figures) right-aligned 21.6 pt from the edge.\n- Track centered 57.4 pt from the top: a 30.9 pt #FDC21B start token with a white bolt, the avatar, then dashes, then the reward token.\n- Dashes: 11.6 x 6.1 pt #DFDFDF pills, 16.9 pt pitch.\n- Avatar: 32 pt #BDC1CF circle with white initials. Reward: 30 pt #FDC21C squircle (41% radius) with a white ? in Rubik Bold.\n- Every token gets a 2.6 pt white ring.\n- Data rule: avatar position = elapsed time over trip length; slide it along the dashes (linear) and tick the countdown every second.\n- At 0:00, flip the ? token to show the reward.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
